      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_select_03",
      "hash64": "D3AA8408D3BA4F26",
      "text": "그만둔다",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_17",
      "hash64": "AA174AEB935D3067",
      "text": "10000원을\\n기부해 주실 건가요?[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_18",
      "hash64": "AA173FEB935D1DB6",
      "text": "세상에나! 100000원을\\n기부해 주실 건가요!?[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_19",
      "hash64": "AA1740EB935D1F69",
      "text": "목표는 1000000원!\\n항시 대기하고 있겠습니다![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_20",
      "hash64": "AA13C1EB935A11C5",
      "text": "기부하시기에는\\n돈이 부족한 것 같네요...[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_21",
      "hash64": "AA13C0EB935A1012",
      "text": "감사히 받겠습니다!\\n괜찮다면 이걸 받아 주세요![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_22",
      "hash64": "AA13BFEB935A0E5F",
      "text": "목표 금액은 1000000원!\\n현재 [VAR 0x0206(0001,0000)]원이 모였답니다.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "0206",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_23",
      "hash64": "AA13BEEB935A0CAC",
      "text": "이, 이럴 수가!\\n방금 받은 돈을 더했더니...[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_38",
      "hash64": "AA1043EB935705D4",
      "text": "목표 금액이었던\\n1000000원을 달성했습니다~!![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_24",
      "hash64": "AA13BDEB935A0AF9",
      "text": "이제 드디어\\n세벗 석상을 복원시킬 수 있겠네요![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_25",
      "hash64": "AA13BCEB935A0946",
      "text": "그럼 바로 업자에게 전화를...\\n띠 띠 띠... 띠리리리링![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_26",
      "hash64": "AA13BBEB935A0793",
      "text": "아~ 여보세요? 나야, 날세.\\n전에 말했던 그거, 돈이 다 모였으니\\r\\n공사를 진행해 주게나![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_27",
      "hash64": "AA13BAEB935A05E0",
      "text": "공사가 끝났다는군요!\\n모처럼이니 저와 같이 보러 가시죠![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_28",
      "hash64": "AA13C9EB935A1F5D",
      "text": "오오... 이게 바로...![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
